<div class="page-header">
  <h2>Funders</h2>
  <a href="/funders/new" class="btn btn-primary">+ Add</a>
</div>
<p class="page-desc">Foundations and grant-making organizations that fund work in your areas of focus — track giving history, priorities, and relationship status.</p>

<details class="how-to">
  <summary>How to use Funders</summary>
  <div class="how-to-body">
    <ol>
      <li>Funders are <strong>grant-making organizations</strong> — foundations, federal agencies with grant programs, state arts councils, and corporate giving programs.</li>
      <li>Add a funder before creating a grant opportunity so you can link them together and see all grants from that funder in one place.</li>
      <li>Use <strong>Type</strong> to categorize: Federal (e.g. NEA, IMLS), State (e.g. California Arts Council), Foundation (e.g. private foundations), Corporate.</li>
      <li>On a funder's detail page, record their giving priorities, funding cycles, average award sizes, and any relationship notes — this informs your application strategy.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>Tip: Research a funder's past awards on USASpending.gov or their annual report before applying — knowing who they've funded before helps you frame your proposal.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<form class="filter-bar" method="GET" action="/funders">
  <input type="text" name="q" value="<%= filters.q || '' %>" placeholder="Search name…" class="filter-input">
  <select name="type" class="filter-select">
    <option value="">All Types</option>
    <% ['Federal','State','Foundation','Corporate','Other'].forEach(function(t) { %>
      <option value="<%= t %>" <%= filters.type === t ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= t %></option>
    <% }); %>
  </select>
  <button type="submit" class="btn btn-secondary">Filter</button>
  <a href="/funders" class="btn-link">Clear</a>
</form>

<% if (funders.length === 0) { %>
  <p class="empty-state">No funders found.</p>
<% } else { %>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="data-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Eligible Institutions</th><th>Website</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <% funders.forEach(function(f) { %>
          <tr>
            <td><a href="/funders/<%= f.id %>"><%= f.name %></a></td>
            <td><span class="badge"><%= f.funder_type %></span></td>
            <td><%= f.eligible_institution_types ? f.eligible_institution_types.substring(0,60) + (f.eligible_institution_types.length > 60 ? '…' : '') : '—' %></td>
            <td><% if (f.website) { %><a href="<%= f.website %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&#8599;</a><% } else { %>—<% } %></td>
          </tr>
        <% }); %>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
<% } %>

<section class="card" id="import" style="margin-top:2rem">
  <h3>Import Funders from CSV</h3>
  <p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:.75rem;">
    Upload a .csv file or paste CSV text to bulk-import funders. Existing funders (matched by name) are skipped.
    Required column: <code>name</code>. Optional: <code>funder_type</code>, <code>website</code>, <code>eligible_institution_types</code>, <code>notes</code>.
  </p>
  <details style="margin-bottom:.85rem;">
    <summary style="font-size:.85rem;cursor:pointer;color:var(--text-muted);">Show CSV template</summary>
    <pre style="font-size:.78rem;background:var(--bg-subtle,#f5f5f5);padding:.6rem .85rem;border-radius:4px;margin-top:.4rem;overflow-x:auto;">name,funder_type,website,eligible_institution_types,notes
Andrew W. Mellon Foundation,Foundation,https://mellon.org,Museums; Libraries; Archives,Major arts and humanities funder
NEH,Federal,https://neh.gov,All,Preservation and digitization grants</pre>
  </details>
  <form action="/funders/import-csv" method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data">
    <div class="form-group">
      <label style="font-weight:600;">Upload CSV file</label>
      <input type="file" name="csv_file" accept=".csv,text/csv,text/plain" style="display:block;margin-top:.35rem;">
      <span style="font-size:.8rem;color:var(--text-muted);">Max 5 MB · .csv or .txt</span>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center;margin:.5rem 0;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--text-muted);">— or paste CSV text below —</div>
    <div class="form-group">
      <textarea name="csv_data" rows="7" placeholder="Paste CSV here (first row must be column headers)…" style="width:100%;font-family:monospace;font-size:.82rem;resize:vertical;"></textarea>
    </div>
    <div class="form-actions">
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Import Funders</button>
    </div>
  </form>
</section>
